  "description_short": "Casual beachfront spot in Plett serving fresh seafood and grills with sweeping ocean views.",
  "description_long": "Perched right on Marine Way, Blue Whale Restaurant delivers what Plettenberg Bay does best: fresh seafood with a view. The relaxed atmosphere makes it ideal for families and groups who want to linger over a meal while watching the waves roll in. The menu leans into coastal classics—think line fish, calamari, and prawns—alongside hearty grills and burgers that satisfy landlubbers too.\n\nThe location is unbeatable, just steps from Central Beach and the town's buzzing beachfront energy. Whether you're catching breakfast before a beach walk or settling in for a sundowner, the ocean backdrop adds something special to every visit. Service is laid-back and friendly, reflecting the easy-going Plett vibe. It's the kind of place where you kick off your sandals, order something grilled, and let the sea breeze do the rest.",
